<title>ITALY: CYCLING-TOUR OF LOMBARDY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-TOUR OF LOMBARDY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERGAMO, Italy 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results in the</p>
<p>250-kms Tour of Lombardy cycling race on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Andrea Tafi (Italy) five hours 51 minutes 46 seconds</p>
<p>2. Fabian Jeker (Switzerland) two minutes 19 seconds behind</p>
<p>3. Axel Merckx (Belgium) 2:22 behind</p>
<p>4. Daniele Nardello (Italy) 2:29 behind</p>
<p>5. Davide Rebellin (Italy) same timte as Nardello</p>
<p>6. Gianni Bugno (Italy) 3:03 behind</p>
<p>7. Richard Virenque (France) 3:04 behind</p>
<p>8. Mauro Gianetti (Switzerland)</p>
<p>9. Laurent Jalabert (France)</p>
<p>10. Andrea Peron (Italy) all same time as Virenque</p>
</text>
